    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">50 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Concurrency</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Asked at Uber, Razorpay, Walmart, Salesforce</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Producer-Consumer &amp; Blocking Queues</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Build a bounded blocking queue three ways (wait/notifyAll, Lock with two Conditions, <code>BlockingQueue</code>), shut it down cleanly with a poison pill, decide what happens when it fills up (backpressure), and see that it is the same ring buffer your NIC driver already uses.</p>\n"
